# unrolled: each source pixel loaded once (lw) and stored once or twice
# (sw). A row with the source row of the one before is a copy of it
# (lq, sq). Rows: bcbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbbcbb
